Description: Patterns as functions of time, a mini-notation for writing them,
    and an offline sample synthesizer that renders them to WAV. A clean-room,
    MIT-licensed music live-coding engine in R, with an optional Rust
    accelerator (extendr) for the Schroeder reverb.
